# `lib/` here is SOURCE, not a build output — plain committed ESM with a
# hand-written `index.d.ts`, exactly like `@gjsify/resolve-npm`. That is what
# lets a zero-install CI script import these rule modules by relative path with
# no `node_modules` and no compiled output. Re-include it against the root
# `.gitignore`'s blanket `lib/`.
!lib/
